  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/845",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8dc7fa502ca82847c4474605b0ba80f231268085\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8dc7fa502ca82847c4474605b0ba80f231268085\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1054\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">코로나 때 이 영상을 보고 수업을 해봐야겠다고 생각했습니다.<br><br>암석의 순환을 배우면서 모둠을 정하고 준비물을 가르쳐줬습니다.<br>이 재료들을 가지고 어떻게 암석의 순환을 표현할지 계획서를 작성하라고 했습니다..<br><br>제가 준비한 준비물들이고요..<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e4804b2393894029375e6f37386cc2f557368e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5e4804b2393894029375e6f37386cc2f557368e\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>초콜릿은 전자레인지로 돌려 녹였습니다..<br>가위로 퇴적물을 만들게 했는데 퇴적암을 만들기엔 작게 잘라야하길래 고무망치를 추가로 나눠줬습니다.<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5193cb9bc13b35e5886732b18e5a38e75d1f7e6f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5193cb9bc13b35e5886732b18e5a38e75d1f7e6f\" data-origin-width=\"3359\" data-origin-height=\"2204\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbca82d96c1c53da0a3448f4601b63af1245da6e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbca82d96c1c53da0a3448f4601b63af1245da6e\" data-origin-width=\"2900\" data-origin-height=\"2372\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f663b0aff52441132f91d9fa60e9fcbad581edca\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f663b0aff52441132f91d9fa60e9fcbad581edca\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">활동은 45분 안에 끝났고 비닐봉지를 나눠주고 만들고 남은 초콜릿과 암석들을 모두 가져가게 했더니 행복한 얼굴로 과학 수업이 제일 좋다며 엄지척 날리더군요...허허허...</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
